    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i cant just \"make myself a priority.\" there is no version of this where i just walk away and everything is fine. if i stop, everything falls apart. the kids, the house, the whole thing... i'm stuck in this loop. it's like i'm just waiting for something to break so i don't have to be the one holding it all together anymore.",
